OL,3,ACanadian tourist found guilty of animal
OL,4,Acruelty after stealing Las Vegas
OL,5,Aflamingo from enclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Canadian man has been found guilty of
OL,8,Fanimal cruelty after he took a flamingo
OL,9,Ffrom its enclosure in Las Vegas and
OL,10,Fbrought it back to his hotel room
OL,11,Fduring an alcohol-fuelled bender.
OL,13,FMitchell Fairbarn, who was visiting the
OL,14,FUS city, took the Chilean flamingo
OL,15,Fnamed Peachy from the Flamingo Las
OL,16,FVegas Hotel and Casino in March.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
