OL,3,ACanadian tourist found guilty of animal
OL,4,Acruelty after stealing Las Vegas
OL,5,Aflamingo from enclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FVideos shown at his trial showed a
OL,8,Fsmiling Fairbarn carrying the bird by
OL,9,Fthe neck as he took a lift to his room.
OL,10,FHe testified that he had drunk 30 to 40
OL,11,Fbeers before the incident and said he
OL,12,Fnever meant to harm the animal. He
OL,13,Ffaces nearly five years in prison.
OL,15,FAnimal experts testified the flamingo
OL,16,Fhad feathers torn out and suffered
OL,17,Fblood loss due to Fairbarn's actions.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
